<title>UK: UK's ITC clears Grampian/Scottish Media deal.</title>
<headline>UK's ITC clears Grampian/Scottish Media deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK's Independent Television Commission (ITC) said on Friday it would not carry out a public interest test on the proposed merger between Scottish Media Group and Grampian Television.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the 1996 Broadcasting Act, the ITC can examine whether common control of newspapers and television services is likely to operate against the public interest.</p>
</text>
